  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceFerret": "Your face has mustelid muzzle, with a ferret-like visage and a cute pink nose. It is covered by a layer of soft, [furcolor] colored fur, with patches of white on your muzzle and cheeks."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceFerretFur": "Your face has mustelid muzzle, with a ferret-like visage and a cute pink nose. It's covered by a layer of soft, [furcolor] colored fur, with patches of white on your muzzle and cheeks. A noticeable mask of [furcolor] fur is shaped around your eyes."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceFerretMask": "The [skinfurscales] around your eyes is significantly darker than the rest of your face, giving you a cute little ferret mask."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceFerretPlain": "Your face is an adorable cross between human and ferret features, complete with a wet nose and whiskers. The only oddity is your lack of fur, leaving only [skin] visible on your ferret-like face."
