  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceFoxPlain": "You have a tapered, shrewd-looking vulpine face with a speckling of downward-curved whiskers just behind the nose. Oddly enough, there's no fur on your animalistic muzzle, just [skinfurscales]."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceFoxScales": "You have a tapered, shrewd-looking vulpine face with a speckling of downward-curved whiskers just behind the nose. Strangely, [skinfurscales] adorn every [if (metric) {bit|inch}] of your animalistic visage."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceGnoll": "You have a gnoll's face, your dark, hyena-like muzzle curled in a perpetual smirk. While your wet nose and panting tongue give the look of a playful pup, your bright orange eyes and savage fangs show you as a wild beast."
