  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FacePig": "Your face is like that of a pig, with [skintone] skin, complete with a snout that is always wiggling."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceRaccoon": "You have a triangular raccoon face, replete with sensitive whiskers and a little black nose; a mask shades the space around your eyes, set apart from your [skinfurscales] by a band of white."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceRaccoonMask": "Your face is human in shape and structure, with [skin], though it is decorated with a sly-looking raccoon mask over your eyes."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceRaccoonMaskFur": "Your [skinfurscales] are decorated with a sly-looking raccoon mask, and under them you have a human-shaped head with [skin]."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceRaccoonMaskPlain": "Your face is human in shape and structure, with [skin], though it is decorated with a sly-looking raccoon mask over your eyes."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceRaccoonPlain": "You have a triangular raccoon face, replete with sensitive whiskers and a little black nose; a mask shades the space around your eyes, set apart from your [skinfurscales] by a band of white. It looks a bit strange with only the skin and no fur."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceRaccoonScales": "You have a triangular raccoon face, replete with sensitive whiskers and a little black nose; a mask shades the space around your eyes, set apart from your [skinfurscales] by a band of white. The presence of said scales gives your visage an eerie look, more reptile than mammal."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceRedPanda": "Your face has a distinctive animalistic muzzle, proper from a red-panda, complete with a cute pink nose. A coat of soft, [furcolor] colored fur covers your head, with patches of white on your muzzle, cheeks and eyebrows."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceRhino": "Your face is like that of a rhino, with a long muzzle and a horn on your nose."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceRhinoFur": "Your face is like that of a rhino with a long muzzle and a horn on your nose. Oddly, your face is also covered in [skinfurscales]."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceRhinoPlain": "Your face is like that of a rhino, with [skin], complete with a long muzzle and a horn on your nose."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceSharkTeeth": "A set of razor-sharp, retractable shark-teeth fill your mouth and gives your visage a slightly angular appearance."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceSnakeFangs": "You have a fairly normal face, with [skin]. The only oddity is your pair of dripping fangs which often hang over your lower lip."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceSnakeFangsFur": "Under your [skinfurscales] you have a human-shaped head with [skin]. In addition, a pair of fangs hang over your lower lip, dripping with venom."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceSnakeFangsPlain": "You have a fairly normal face, with [skin]. The only oddity is your pair of dripping fangs which often hang over your lower lip."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceSnakeFangsScales": "Your face is fairly human in shape, but is covered in [skinfurscales]. In addition, a pair of fangs hang over your lower lip, dripping with venom."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceSpiderFangs": "A set of retractable, needle-like fangs sit in place of your canines and are ready to dispense their venom."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceWolf": "You have an angular wolf's face complete with a muzzle and black nose."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceWolfFur": "You have an angular wolf's face complete with a muzzle and black nose."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.FaceWolfPlain": "You have an angular wolf's face complete with a muzzle and black nose, though devoid of any fur."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Gender.Female": "female"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Gender.Genderless": "genderless"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Gender.Hermaphrodite": "hermaphrodite"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Gender.Male": "male"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.GillsAnemone": "A pair of feathery gills are growing out just below your neck, spreading out horizontally and draping down your chest. They allow you to stay in the water for quite a long time."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.GillsNeck": "A set of fish like gills reside on your neck, several small slits that can close flat against your skin. They allow you to stay in the water for quite a long time."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HairBald": "You are totally bald, showing only shiny [skintone] [skindesc] where your hair should be."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HairBaldFur": "You have no hair, only a thin layer of fur atop of your head."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HairBaldWool": "You have no hair, only a thin layer of wool atop of your head."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HipsFat": "You have {0}, emphasized by your thick frame."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HipsStd": "You have {0}."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HipsThin": "You have {0}, matched by your trim, lithe body."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsAntelope": "Two thick antelope horns sprout from your head in slight curves that point in at the tips."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsAntlers": "Two antlers, forking into {0} points, have sprouted from the top of your head, forming a spiky, regal crown of bone."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsDemon2": "A small pair of pointed horns has broken through the [skindesc] on your forehead, proclaiming some demonic taint to any who see them."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsDemon4": "A quartet of prominent horns has broken through your [skindesc]. The back pair are longer, and curve back along your head. The front pair protrude forward demonically."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsDemon6": "Six horns have sprouted through your [skindesc], the back two pairs curve backwards over your head and down towards your neck, while the front two horns stand almost {0} long upwards and a little forward."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsDemon8": "A large number of thick demonic horns sprout through your [skindesc], each pair sprouting behind the ones before. The front jut forwards nearly {0} while the rest curve back over your head, some of the points ending just below your ears. You estimate you have a total of {1} horns."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsDraconicX2": "A pair of {0} horns grow from the sides of your head, sweeping backwards and adding to your imposing visage."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsDraconicX4": "Two pairs of horns, roughly [if (metric) {thirty centimeters|a foot}] long, sprout from the sides of your head. They sweep back and give you a fearsome look, almost like the dragons from your village's legends."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsGoatLarge": "A pair of tall-standing goat horns sprout from the sides of your head. They are curved and patterned with ridges."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsGoatSmall": "A pair of stubby goat horns sprout from the sides of your head."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsImp": "A set of pointed imp horns rest atop your head."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsMinotaur0": "Two tiny horn-like nubs protrude from your forehead, resembling the horns of the young livestock kept by your village."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsMinotaur12": "Two very large and dangerous looking horns sprout from your head, curving forward and over a [if (metric) {third of a meter|foot}] long. They have dangerous looking points."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsMinotaur20": "Two huge horns erupt from your forehead, curving outward at first, then forwards. The weight of them is heavy, and they end in dangerous looking points."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsMinotaur3": "Two moderately sized horns grow from your forehead, similar in size to those on a young bovine."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsMinotaur6": "Two large horns sprout from your forehead, curving forwards like those of a bull."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsRamLarge": "A set of large {0} inch ram horns sit atop your head, curling around in a tight spiral at the side of your head before coming to an upwards hook around your ears."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsRamSmall": "A set of {0} inch ram horns sit atop your head, curling around in a tight spiral at the side of your head before coming to an upwards hook around your ears."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsRhino": "A single horn sprouts from your forehead. It is conical and resembles a rhino's horn. You estimate it to be about {0} long."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsRhinoSecond": "A second horn sprouts from your forehead just above the horn on your nose. You estimate it to be about {0} long."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsSheepLarge": "A pair of large sheep horns sit atop your head. They curl out and upwards in a crescent shape."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsSheepSmall": "A pair of small sheep horns sit atop your head. They curl out and upwards in a slight crescent shape."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsUnicornLong": "A single sharp nub of a horn sprouts from the center of your forehead. It has developed its own cute little spiral. You estimate it to be about {0} long, {1} thick and very sturdy. A very useful natural weapon."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsUnicornShort": "A single sharp nub of a horn sprouts from the center of your forehead. You estimate it to be about {0} long."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsUnknown": "A set of horns sprouts from your head."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsWooden": "The branches growing on your head resemble the antlers of a woodland animal."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HornsWoodenOld": "The horns you once had still poke out of your skull, but now with the texture of wood."
