  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsBat": "Your legs grow down from your waist and end in feet that have long, gripping, clawed toes."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsBee": "Your legs are covered in a shimmering insectile carapace up to mid-thigh, looking more like a set of 'fuck-me-boots' than exoskeleton. A bit of downy yellow and black fur fuzzes your upper thighs, just like a bee."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsBunny": "Your legs thicken below the waist as they turn into soft-furred rabbit-like legs. You even have large bunny feet that make hopping around a little easier than walking."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsCat": "Digitigrade legs grow downwards from your waist, ending in soft, padded cat-paws."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsClaws": "Your lithe legs are capped with flexible clawed feet. Sharp black nails grow where once you had toe-nails, giving you fantastic grip."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsCloven": "Digitigrade legs form below your hips, ending in cloven hooves."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsCockatrice": "Digitigrade legs grow down from your hips, ending in clawed feet. There are three long toes on the front, and a small hind-claw on the back. A layer of feathers covers your legs from the hip to the knee, ending in a puffy cuff."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsDog": "Digitigrade legs grow downwards from your waist, ending in dog-like hind-paws."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsDragon": "Human-like legs grow down from your hips, sheathed in scales and ending in clawed feet. There are three long toes on the front, and a small hind-claw on the back."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsDrider": "Where your legs would normally start you have grown the body of a spider."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsFerret": "Your legs are equally covered in [hairorfurcolor] fur, the lower half having a darker shade. They end on digitigrade ferret paws with short claws."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsFox": "Your legs are crooked into high knees with hocks and long feet, like those of a fox; cute bulbous toes decorate the ends."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsGnoll": "Two digitigrade legs grow downwards from your waist, [furcolor] spotted fur coating them from the thigh down. They end in padded paw-feet with small claws."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsGoo": "In place of legs you have a shifting amorphous blob. Thankfully it is quite easy to propel yourself around on."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsHarpy": "Your legs are covered with [hairorfurcolor] plumage. Thankfully the thick, powerful thighs are perfect for launching you into the air, and your feet remain mostly human, even if they are two-toed and tipped with talons."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsHighHeels": "Your perfect lissome legs end in mostly human feet, apart from the horn protruding straight down from the heel that forces you to walk with a sexy, swaying gait."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsHoofed": "Your legs are muscled and jointed oddly, covered in fur, and end in bestial hooves."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsHuman": "Your normal human legs grow down from your waist, ending in normal human feet."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsImp": "Digitigrade legs form below your hips, ending in clawed feet. Three extend out the front, and one smaller one is in the back to keep your balance."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsKangaroo": "Your furry legs have short thighs and long calves, with even longer feet ending in prominently-nailed toes."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsLizard": "Digitigrade legs grow down from your hips, ending in clawed feet. There are three long toes on the front, and a small hind-claw on the back."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsMermaid": "Below your waist your flesh is fused together into a very long fish-like tail."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsNaga": "Below your waist your flesh is fused together into a very long snake-like tail."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsPony": "From the waist down you have an incredibly cute and cartoonish parody of a horse body, ending in flat, rounded feet."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsRaccoon": "Your legs, though covered in fur, are humanlike. Long feet on the ends bear equally long toes, and the pads on the bottoms are quite sensitive to the touch."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsRedPanda": "Your legs are equally covered in fur, ending on red-panda paws with short claws. They have a nimble and strong build, in case you need to escape from something."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsRoot": "You have two sets of coiled roots, winding down to form plantigrade legs."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsSalamander": "Digitigrade legs covered in thick, leathery red scales up to the mid-thigh grow down from your hips, ending in clawed feet. There are three long toes on the front, and a small hind-claw on the back."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsSpider": "Your legs are covered in a reflective black, insectile carapace up to your mid-thigh, looking more like a set of 'fuck-me-boots' than exoskeleton."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.LegsWolf": "You have digitigrade legs that end in wolf paws."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Line": "{0}: {1}"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Name": "Appearance"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.NeckBendLong": "You are able to bend it in almost every direction and with some effort you even manage to take a glimpse at your back."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.NeckBendMedium": "You can bend it more than others with low effort."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.NeckBendShort": "You can bend it a bit more than others with some effort."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.NeckCockatrice": "Around your neck is a ruff of {0} feathers which tends to puff out with your emotions."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.NeckDraconic": "Where normal humans have a short neck, yours is {0}, measuring {1} inches."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.NeckDraconicExtremely": "extremely long"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.NeckDraconicFew": "a few inches longer"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.NeckDraconicSomewhat": "somewhat longer"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.NeckDraconicVery": "very long"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Number.Eight": "eight"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Number.Five": "five"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Number.Four": "four"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Number.One": "one"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Number.Seven": "seven"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Number.Six": "six"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Number.Three": "three"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Number.Two": "two"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Opening": "You are a {0} tall {1} {2}{3}, with {4}."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Wearing": " <b>You are currently {0} and using your {1} as a weapon.</b>"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HairPinInHair": " <b>You have a hair-pin with a single red feather plume in your [hair].</b>"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.HairPinOnHead": " <b>You have a hair-pin with a single red feather plume on your head.</b>"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Jewelry": " <b>Girding one of your fingers is {0}.</b>"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Piercing": "piercing"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Nipples": "nipples"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.EarsPierced": "\nYour ears are pierced with {0}."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.NipplesPierced": "\nYour {0} are pierced with {1}."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Parasites.Eel.Leak": "Every few moments, one of the creatures slides out of your [vagina], twists aimlessly, and hides itself again."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Parasites.Eel.Plural": "Bulges appears on your belly sometimes, signaling the presence of the eel parasites."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Parasites.Eel.Several": "Several bulges appear on your belly, sliding across your abdomen, signaling you're infested with eel parasites."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Parasites.Eel.Single": "A small bulge appears on your belly sometimes, signaling the presence of the eel parasite."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Parasites.Nephila.Eight": "The paper-thin flesh of your stomach is now almost fully transparent as it stretches over a womb that would make the barn at Whitney farm look like a snug fit. It is time to embrace destiny."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Parasites.Nephila.Five": "Your belly protrudes unnaturally far forward, shiny with pressure as it tries to contain the brood of tentacles within it. It is constantly sloshing with the movement of the tentacles within you."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Parasites.Nephila.Four": "Your stomach is painfully distended by the nephila tentacles in your womb, making you seem impossibly pregnant. Bulges frequently appear on your belly's surface."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Parasites.Nephila.Leak": "Every few moments, one of the slimes burbles out of your [vagina], twisting aimlessly, and then burrows back into your womb."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Parasites.Nephila.One": "Your belly appears to be full-term pregnant and frequently squirms, signaling the presence of the tentacles of that odd slime girl within you."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Parasites.Nephila.Seven": "You resemble nothing more than a girl strapped to a room filling, slime packed balloon. A strong nesting instinct has taken hold in you."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Parasites.Nephila.Six": "Your nephila packed belly dwarfs the rest of your body, rendering you a vestigial accessory to your womb."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Parasites.Nephila.Three": "Your belly appears to be full-term pregnant with triplets and frequently squirms, signaling the presence of the tentacles of that odd slime girl within you."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Parasites.Nephila.Two": "Your belly appears to be full-term pregnant with twins and frequently squirms, signaling the presence of the tentacles of that odd slime girl within you."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Bulge": "Your belly is more noticeably distended. You are probably pregnant."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Butt.Generic": "Your belly is swollen with pregnancy."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Distended": "Your stomach is painfully distended by your pregnancy, making it difficult to walk normally."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Early": "Your belly is larger than it used to be."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Eggs.Basketball": "basketball"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Eggs.BeachBall": "beach ball"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Eggs.Early": "Your belly is somewhat swollen with eggs."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Eggs.LargeMedicineBall": "large medicine ball"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Eggs.Size": "Your swollen pregnant belly is as large as a {0}."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Eggs.Watermelon": "watermelon"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Faerie.Belly": "Your belly remains swollen like a watermelon. {0}"
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Faerie.Liquid": "It's full of liquid, though unlike a normal pregnancy the passenger you're carrying is tiny."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Faerie.Solid": "It still feels like there's a solid ball inside your womb."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Faerie.Syrup": "It feels like it's full of thick syrup or jelly."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Frog.Full": "You're stuffed so full with eggs that your belly looks obscenely distended, huge and weighted with the gargantuan eggs crowding your gut. They make your gait a waddle and your gravid tummy wobble obscenely."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Frog.Waddle": "Your stomach is so full of frog eggs that you look about to birth at any moment, your belly wobbling and shaking with every step you take, packed with frog ovum."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.GooStuffed": "Your gravid-looking belly is absolutely stuffed full of goo. There's no way you can get pregnant like this, but at the same time, you look like some fat-bellied breeder."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Large": "It would be impossible to conceal your growing pregnancy from anyone who glanced your way."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Marble.FullTerm": "Your belly protrudes unnaturally far forward, bulging outwards with Marble's precious child."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Native.FullTerm": "Your belly protrudes unnaturally far forward, bulging with the unclean spawn of some monster or beast."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Nephila.ArchQueen": "Your vagina is a gaping maw, laden with pillowy labia and crowned by a gelatinous, fleshy clitoris the same size and general width as your head. The poor, tortured love bud bulges around the edges of a platinum circlet that circumnavigates its center. The loop burns red hot and leaves you hyper-aware of every iota of movement in your nerve-laden button. Some of your tentacle babies can be seen snaking partially out of your womb to cradle the obese protuberance, spreading their soothing slimes in a futile effort to ease the intense sexual pleasure you deal with at every moment as a result of the crown's burning."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Noticeable": "The unmistakable bulge of pregnancy is visible in your tummy."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Obvious": "Your belly is very obviously pregnant to anyone who looks at you."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Satyr.Bulge": "The unmistakable bulge of pregnancy is visible in your tummy, yet it feels odd inside you--wrong somehow."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Satyr.Painful": "Your stomach is painfully distended by your pregnancy, making it difficult to walk normally."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Satyr.PotBelly": "You've got the beginnings of a small pot-belly."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Urta.Bulge": "Your belly is more noticeably distended. You're pretty sure it's Urta's."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Urta.Distended": "Your stomach is painfully distended by your pregnancy, making it difficult to walk normally."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Urta.FullTerm": "Your belly protrudes unnaturally far forward, bulging with the spawn of one of this land's natives."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Urta.Heavy": "Your belly is large and very obviously pregnant to anyone who looks at you. It's gotten heavy enough to be a pain to carry around all the time."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Urta.Kicking": "The unmistakable bulge of pregnancy is visible in your tummy, and the baby within is kicking nowadays."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Urta.Larger": "Your belly is larger than it used to be."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.Pregnancy.Urta.Round": "It would be impossible to conceal your growing pregnancy from anyone who glanced your way. It's large and round, frequently moving."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.RaceChange": "You began your journey as {0}, but gave that up as you explored the dangers of this realm. "
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.RearBark": "Rough bark coats your hips and back, providing an extra layer of toughness."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.RearFin": "A large shark-like fin has sprouted between your shoulder blades. With it you have far more control over swimming underwater."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.RearMane": "Tracing your spine, a mane of [rearbodycolor] hair grows; starting at the base of your neck and continuing down your tail, ending on the tip of your tail in a small tuft. It reminds you vaguely of a horse mane."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.RearSpikes": "Tracing your spine, a row of short steel-gray and curved backwards spikes protrude; starting at the base of your neck and continuing down your tail, ending on the tip of your tail. It reminds you very vaguely of a horse mane."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailBee": "A large insectile bee-abdomen dangles from just above your backside, bobbing with its own weight as you shift. It is covered in hard chitin with black and yellow stripes, and tipped with a dagger-like stinger."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailBeeCoated": "Poisonous bee venom coats your stinger completely."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailBeeDrips": "Venom drips from your poisoned stinger regularly."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailBeeDrop": "A single drop of poison hangs from your exposed stinger."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailCat": "A soft [hairorfurcolor] cat-tail sprouts just above your [butt], curling and twisting with every step to maintain perfect balance."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailCockatrice": "A thick, scaly, prehensile reptilian tail hangs from your [butt], about half as long as you are tall. The first [if (metric) {couple centimeters or so are|inch or so is}] feathered, terminating in a v-shape and giving way to your [skintone] scales."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailConceal": "Your sex is concealed within a cavity in your tail when not in use, though when the need arises, you can part your concealing slit and reveal your true self."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailCow": "A long cowtail with a puffy tip swishes back and forth as if swatting at flies."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailDeer": "A very short, stubby deer tail sprouts from just above your butt."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailDemonic": "A narrow tail ending in a spaded tip curls down from your [butt], wrapping around your [leg] sensually at every opportunity."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailDog": "A fuzzy [hairorfurcolor] dogtail sprouts just above your [butt], wagging to and fro whenever you are happy."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailDraconic": "A thick, muscular, reptilian tail, almost as long as you are tall, unconsciously swings behind you slowly from side to side. Its tip menaces with sharp spikes of bone, and could easily cause grievous harm with a single, powerful sweep."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailEchidna": "A stumpy echidna tail forms just about your [ass]."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailFerret": "Sprouting from your backside, you have a long, bushy tail. It is covered in a fluffy layer of [hairorfurcolor] fur. It twitches and moves happily with your body when you are excited."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailFox": "A swishing [hairorfurcolor] fox's brush extends from your [ass], curling around your body--the soft fur feels lovely."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailFoxMulti": "{0} swishing [hairorfurcolor] fox's tails extend from your [ass], curling around your body--the soft fur feels lovely."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailGnoll": "A rough-furred [hairorfurcolor] gnoll tail sprouts just above your [butt], wagging to and fro, as to signal your mood."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailGoat": "A very short, stubby goat tail sprouts from just above your butt."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailHarpy": "A tail of feathers fans out from just above your [ass], twitching instinctively to help guide you if you were to take flight."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailHorse": "A long [haircolor] horsetail hangs from your [butt], smooth and shiny."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailImp": "A thin imp tail almost as long as you are tall hangs from above your [butt], dotted at the end with a small puff of hair."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailKangaroo": "A conical, furry tail extends from your [ass], bouncing up and down as you move and helping to counterbalance you."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailLizard": "A tapered tail hangs down from just above your [ass]. It sways back and forth, assisting you with keeping your balance."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailMouse": "A naked, [skintone] mouse tail pokes from your butt, dragging on the ground and twitching occasionally."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailPig": "A short, curly pig tail sprouts from just above your butt."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailRabbit": "A short, soft bunny tail sprouts just above your [ass], twitching constantly whenever you do not think about it."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailRaccoon": "A black-and-gray-ringed raccoon tail waves behind you."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailRedPanda": "Sprouting from your backside, you have a long, bushy tail. It has a beautiful pattern of rings in [furcolor] fluffy fur. It waves playfully as you walk, giving your step a mesmerizing touch."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailRhino": "A ropey rhino tail sprouts from just above your butt, swishing from time to time."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailSalamander": "A tapered, red-scaled tail hangs down from just above your [ass]. It sways back and forth, assisting you with keeping your balance. All it takes is a moment of concentration to set your entire tail ablaze in red-hot fire."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailScorpion": "A chitinous scorpion tail sprouts from just above your butt, ready to dispense venom."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailShark": "A long shark-tail trails down from your backside, swaying to and fro while giving you a dangerous air."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailSheep": "A fluffy sheep tail hangs down from your [butt]. It occasionally twitches and shakes, its puffy fluff begging to be touched."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailSpider": "A large, spherical spider-abdomen has grown out from your backside, covered in shiny black chitin. Though it is heavy and bobs with every motion, it does not seem to slow you down."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailSpiderBursting": "Your swollen spider-butt is distended with the sheer amount of webbing it's holding."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailSpiderFull": "Your bulging arachnid posterior feels fairly full of webbing."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailSpiderVeryFull": "Your arachnid rear bulges and feels very full of webbing."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TailWolf": "A thick-furred wolf tail hangs above your [ass]."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TaurLegsHoofed": "From the waist down you have the body of a horse, with all your legs capped by hooves."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TaurLegsPony": "From the waist down you have an incredibly cute and cartoonish parody of a horse's body, with all your legs ending in flat, rounded feet."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TongueCat": "Your tongue is rough like that of a cat, being covered in tiny, rigid spines."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TongueDemonic": "A slowly undulating tongue occasionally slips from between your lips. It hangs [if (metric) {half a meter|nearly two feet}] long when you let the whole thing slide out, though you can retract it to appear normal."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TongueDraconic": "Your mouth contains a thick, fleshy tongue that, if you so desire, can telescope to a distance of about [if (metric) {a meter|four feet}]. It has sufficient manual dexterity that you can use it almost like a third arm."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TongueEchidna": "A thin echidna tongue, at least [if (metric) {thirty centimeters|a foot}] long, occasionally flits out from between your lips."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TongueLizard": "Your mouth contains a thick, fleshy lizard tongue, bringing to mind the tongue of large predatory reptiles. It can reach up to [if (metric) {thirty centimeters|one foot}], its forked tips tasting the air as they flick at the end of each movement."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.TongueSnake": "A snake-like tongue occasionally flits between your lips, tasting the air."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsBatLarge": "A pair of large bat-like demon-wings fold behind your shoulders. With a muscle-twitch, you can extend them, and use them to soar gracefully through the air."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsBatTiny": "A pair of tiny bat-like demon-wings sprout from your back, flapping cutely, but otherwise being of little use."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsBeeLarge": "A pair of large bee-wings sprout from your back, reflecting the light through their clear membranes beautifully. They flap quickly, allowing you to easily hover in place or fly."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsBeeSmall": "A pair of tiny-yet-beautiful bee-wings sprout from your back, too small to allow you to fly."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsDraconicLarge": "Magnificent wings sprout from your shoulders. When unfurled they stretch further than your arm span, and a single beat of them is all you need to set out toward the sky. They look a bit like bat wings, but the membranes are covered in fine, delicate [wingcolor] scales supported by [wingcolor2] bones. A wicked talon juts from the end of each bone."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsDraconicSmall": "Small, vestigial wings sprout from your shoulders. They might look like bat wings, but the membranes are covered in fine, delicate [wingcolor] scales supported by [wingcolor2] bones."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsDragonfly": "Giant dragonfly wings hang from your shoulders. At a whim, you could twist them into a whirring rhythm fast enough to lift you off the ground and allow you to fly."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsFaerieLarge": "A pair of large, translucent faerie wings spread behind your shoulders, shimmering with faint light as they beat."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsFaerieSmall": "A pair of tiny, translucent faerie wings flutter behind your shoulders, too small to lift you into the air."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsFeathered": "A pair of large, feathery wings sprout from your back. Though you usually keep the [wingcolor]-colored wings folded close, they can unfurl to allow you to soar as gracefully as a harpy."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsHarpy": "A pair of feathered harpy wings sprout from your back, allowing you to glide gracefully through the air."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsImp": "A pair of imp wings sprout from your back, flapping cutely but otherwise being of little use."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsImpLarge": "A pair of large imp wings fold behind your shoulders. With a muscle-twitch, you can extend them, and use them to soar gracefully through the air."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsWeeping": "From your back, two drooping, bony limbs with twisted ribbons of flesh hanging from them extend out like wings. Though you're able to flex and move them, the skeletal-like structure isn't capable of flight."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsWillow": "From your back, two drooping branches with spiral-shaped leaves extend out like wings. Though you're able to flex and move them, they aren't capable of flight."
  "Scenes.PlayerAppearance.WingsWooden": "From your back, branches of wood extend out into a framework resembling wings you once had. Though you're able to flex and move them, the skeletal-like structure isn't capable of flight."
}
